  "title": "Dad&#39;s Cookies",
  "description": "One of Grandma Dorothy&#39;s much sought-after recipes is for Dad&#39;s cookies. These oatmeal cookies are wonderfully chewy and are made with oil instead of butter or margarine, appealing to the health-conscious.",
  "authors": [
